    "selectedTakeDetails": [
      {
        "id": "01-input-matrix-1",
        "text": "省份数量这道题，输入是一个二维数组；行和列都对应城市，一表示直接相连，零表示没有直连。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "fb2b69a20fda6c99e2335646793a7cbac3a60dad3660ed7f4b824d0c66e2410f",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.3280416666666657,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.33,
        "keptSamples": 393152,
        "sourceSamples": 423266,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9971624095222446
      },
      {
        "id": "01-input-matrix-2",
        "text": "要返回的是省份总数；这个教学示例有六座城市，行列下标零到五，画图时依次标成A到F。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "bcbf790e1b85d9de4d0263e5eca22453cd428a73dca5af7a0da9974affd741ce",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.34841666666666526,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.35,
        "keptSamples": 494965,
        "sourceSamples": 526484,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9931784082915733
      },
      {
        "id": "02-matrix-to-graph-1",
        "text": "看行零、列一，这里是一，表示A和B直接相连；行零、列二是零，A和C之间不画直线。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "22d45653e35b68233a8e3aad70718fe31d4e19cfc7c15460ce4b0a3880821560",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.4212499999999988,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.42,
        "keptSamples": 467342,
        "sourceSamples": 502140,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9996482821778438
      },
      {
        "id": "02-matrix-to-graph-2",
        "text": "照着表，再画出B连C、D连E；对角线只表示自己，F没有连接其他城市。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "43d967cc5e0544b67a7836a5ea40fa11b21141373e65bd6260d61d169e113366",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.5100833333333323,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.51,
        "keptSamples": 364453,
        "sourceSamples": 403684,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9981546478693032
      },
      {
        "id": "03-province-1",
        "text": "题目把直接或间接相连的城市算作一个省份；A和C不直连，却能经过B连通。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "d06a6e409938eca7208da1c3c1631be8e5401443cbf5d485a9d4b348e1f09517",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.4306666666666663,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.43,
        "keptSamples": 359400,
        "sourceSamples": 394592,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9980518393730805
      },
      {
        "id": "03-province-2",
        "text": "所以ABC算一省，DE算一省，F独立也算一省，最后返回三。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "551e8a3b344242bfeb807481e3c1a8a96e6062cfe8e47a2b4167f4979feef5a0",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.6339166666666669,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.63,
        "keptSamples": 283160,
        "sourceSamples": 328028,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9994044287332899
      },
      {
        "id": "04-derive-groups-1",
        "text": "接着想怎么做：我们只关心城市分成了几组，不必保存每条中间路线。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "aec1212e273f05e24670d631d7b41c944e33dffd15b91a66747d6e12f99b8f33",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.417416666666667,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.42,
        "keptSamples": 259684,
        "sourceSamples": 294596,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9994950596397539
      },
      {
        "id": "04-derive-groups-2",
        "text": "每看到一对相连城市，若已经同组就不变，只有跨组时才把两组并成一组。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "22b172db6adcd28ceeca30833663ce43f4a1435f7b6eea5ae18da594f0a9ad02",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.4259166666666667,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.43,
        "keptSamples": 299674,
        "sourceSamples": 334844,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9963827834438199
      },
      {
        "id": "05-representative-1",
        "text": "给组一个代表，同组城市只要找到同一个代表，就能判断彼此已经连通。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "c712d6f629468789e22bac27334855e1375d87de759fd959b97a86d46ad25be4",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.3680000000000003,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.37,
        "keptSamples": 275970,
        "sourceSamples": 308064,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9933029511936073
      },
      {
        "id": "05-representative-2",
        "text": "开始还没处理相连关系，六座城市各自成组，因此最初有六个代表。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "3e127cc79291f908e5e6f848f5802924dacd54b4aeffe4117b4e0865b0e3c038",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.47904166666666637,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.48,
        "keptSamples": 279372,
        "sourceSamples": 317234,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9987409277769115
      },
      {
        "id": "06-parent-1",
        "text": "接下来把这个想法存下来：每个城市记录上一级，沿记录找，直到指向自己。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "e117bc9a047207f36c3aeea987b217b8f5de68c94bc4560b7d955a48e8cd0453",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.39187500000000064,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.39,
        "keptSamples": 297930,
        "sourceSamples": 331290,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9982830309267255
      },
      {
        "id": "06-parent-2",
        "text": "这个停下的位置就是根，也就是组代表；这些箭头只是归属记录，不是新连接。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "750f77f12edbf1f6223b859436d52a954cb0463d572c5933ed8c153d153d087d",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.39408333333333356,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.39,
        "keptSamples": 333724,
        "sourceSamples": 367396,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9970400022291454
      },
      {
        "id": "07-name-1",
        "text": "遇到跨组连接，先分别找到两边的根，再把一个根接到另一个根下面。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "404a2141826f9c34eacaf87da25e9bdb9aaccfe4662b70293d45b3e4009c441a",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.3414999999999999,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.34,
        "keptSamples": 256574,
        "sourceSamples": 287592,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9988580071143414
      },
      {
        "id": "07-name-2",
        "text": "并查集就是这样查询同组、合并两组；根不相同才合并，省份数才减一。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "f8c5980f5b546b665f1a9de62324c227dab59bb1c0d283987a939182afab9ffc",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.3868333333333336,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.39,
        "keptSamples": 335318,
        "sourceSamples": 368488,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9975840367478147
      },
      {
        "id": "08-merge-ab-1",
        "text": "现在从头处理主例：看到A和B相连，两个根不同，把它们合成一组。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "77499a2790b80ed1d08cc297159af92d60d4865ad271bea899536418cb7d381c",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.42154166666666626,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.42,
        "keptSamples": 271602,
        "sourceSamples": 306314,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9965161565476173
      },
      {
        "id": "08-merge-ab-2",
        "text": "组数从六变五，B记录A；随后查B时，会沿记录找到代表A。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "bf2cbc77a5076a2582759647faa96415a6d960009d7bc5451fb6461854c8ed5d",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": "historical raw/WAV/sidecar all exact SHA reused",
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.5471250000000003,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.55,
        "keptSamples": 317542,
